# 构建上下文排除项：只把构建需要的东西送进 Docker
.git
.gitignore
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.py[cod]

# 前端：Dist 由 Dockerfile 内重新构建，源码要进去
frontend/dist
frontend/.build-temp
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/.env.local

# 数据：完整数仓/原始数据 10+ GB，绝不进镜像；演示数仓与模型产物要进
backend/data/warehouse
backend/data/staging
backend/data/source
backend/instance
backend/.env
backend/docs
backend/tests
backend/requirements-model.txt

# 文档与截图
docs
*.md
!backend/README.md
